  "title": "Qt: Set RTP Player mouse wheel zoom horizontal only",
  "description": "The RTP Player autoscales the Y-axis by default, so X-axis zooming\nis more useful. The keyboard controls (+ and -) already zoom only\nthe X-axis. Have the mouse wheel zoom do the same.\n\nMouse dragging still allows both axes, though given the autoscaling\nthat might make sense to change too.\n\nAdding the ability to switch to zooming by drawing a box, like\nthe I/O Graph, might be useful as well.",
